  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img1.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">文档介绍</h2>\n<div>本文档是刘小排老师在2024年3月杭州生财有术航海家见面会上的分享，由刘小排老师授权哥飞把PPT整理为本文。</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">关于刘小排老师</h2>\n<div>刘小排老师有着8年AI行业从业经验，也有着丰富的做产品搞流量赚美元经验，如有一个2022年做的网站，在2023最高峰有每月超过800万的访问量。</div>\n<div>刘小排老师在生财有术发表了很多篇精华贴，不完全列举如下：</div>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://wx.zsxq.com/dweb2/index/topic_detail/811452228445512\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">什么产品好做？三个一</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wx.zsxq.com/dweb2/index/topic_detail/212552521858151\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">如何从自己熟悉的领域中找到蓝海？</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wx.zsxq.com/dweb2/index/topic_detail/184214255522812\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">判断项目行不行的极简方法</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wx.zsxq.com/dweb2/index/topic_detail/415414825512158\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">完美的创业项目，是怎么被想出来的？</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wx.zsxq.com/dweb2/index/topic_detail/212828458825481\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">流量密码：普通人用AI做内容创作，有手就行</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wx.zsxq.com/dweb2/index/topic_detail/212485241245121\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">如何获得产品idea</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wx.zsxq.com/dweb2/index/topic_detail/412888158154528\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">搞钱的心法</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wx.zsxq.com/dweb2/index/topic_detail/814822455488822\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">写给独立开发者：如何快速做出产品MVP</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wx.zsxq.com/dweb2/index/topic_detail/188545124485142\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">善用黑科技工具，做十倍速全栈程序员</a></li>\n</ol>\n<div>以上文章，如果已经是生财有术会员，则可以直接打开，非生财有术会员，如果感兴趣，可以扫描下方刘小排老师的邀请码加入生财有术。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img2.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">分享正文</h2>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img3.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>大家好，我是刘小排，已经从事AI产品工作8年。</div>\n<div>我是一名方法论爱好者，今天特别荣幸来到这里，谦卑地跟大家分享我做AI产品的一点点方法论。</div>\n<div>总有人问我，小排老师，我是一个草台班子，不是AI科班出身，怎么靠做AI产品赚钱呢？</div>\n<div>我会告诉他，你问对人了。我最喜欢草台班子，并且，这个世界，往往是由草台班子改变的！</div>\n<div>那么，草台班子改变世界的底层原理是什么呢？他们的方法，又将会怎么应用到AI产品创业上？</div>\n<div>来，让我们从一个我最倾佩的草台班子的故事讲起。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img4.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img5.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img6.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img7.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img8.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img9.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img10.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img11.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img12.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img13.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img14.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img15.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img16.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img17.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img18.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img19.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>1的例子，幻兽帕鲁</div>\n<div>2的例子，前面杜厦的故事</div>\n<div>3的例子，生财有术航海家最近推荐的一本书，十倍优于两倍</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img20.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img21.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img22.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img23.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img24.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img25.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img26.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5p9tdc3sj0_img27.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>好了，以上就是刘小排老师的分享。</div>",
